{"id":"b15ebe94f199828c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-omega-consistency.md","title":"Omega Consistency","display":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-omega-consistency","aliases":["92-df-omega-consistency"],"display":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-omega-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-omega-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-omega-consistency-—-Omega-Consistency-$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}$\">df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (definition-target omega-consistency predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land G\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land G\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性比普通一致性更强</li>\n<li>如果<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\)</span>，则不能对每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>都证明闭实例<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Gödel原始的双向不可证结论采用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性（现代陈述也常分离为普通一致性与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-一致性/可靠性条件）</li>\n<li>Rosser技巧在有效可公理化且足够强的背景下把第一不完备性的双向不可证假设降为普通一致性；这些有效性和强度条件不能省略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-omega-consistency-—-Omega-Consistency-$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}$","text":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency $\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id"